)
	(text "LO path: ADF4371 RF8P 6.6 GHz -> AVA-183A+ -> 3 dB pad -> EP4RKU+ 4-way -> LTC5553 LO x4 (C1_LO..C4_LO). Equal-length routing required."
	(at 210 30 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "63902591-328e-4e68-98cb-cedfeb33049e")
)
	(text "H2-B: loop filter C509/R507/C510/R508/C511 = DERIVED 3rd-order passive (Kv 50 MHz/V nominal, Icp 1.75 mA, N 660, fPFD 10 MHz; 98 kHz BW, 46 deg PM; tools/loop_filter.py) - confirm in ADIsimPLL. RS_SW (fastlock) UNRESOLVED.  AVA-183A+ bias L505/C512-C515 per Mini-Circuits Fig 2 (NPO 0402, L1 wire-wound 0805); ML1-ML7 microstrips + pads 1,6 to GND per PL-328."
	(at 210 35 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
